  "normalizations": [
    "Execute the exact source tests and assert complete Azure/azd observations and fake-client backend calls equal. Preserve all request/result/warning/error fields and declared host differences.",
    "Native uses production SDKTransport with strict synthetic HTTP responses derived from those source fake-client calls, not service recordings. A delegating observer captures real SDK results/name operands plus parsed local kind/sort/yes flags; no fake results or network fallback. Source fake analyzers omit status. Inject only status:ready into synthetic native wire analyzers and complete native expected list/backend results; retain original source observations unchanged. The unadapted source models must fail existing native wire validation; never loosen production.",
    "Conflict remains a proposed difference: source usage/message/null hint versus native validation/safe message/actionable hint and explicit code. Preserve both complete errors. Default/JSON outputs are compared in full; output-none is a separate quiet-output contract. Dummy Entra/session injection does not prove live authentication, RBAC or installed-host behavior."
